---
name: Value Plus Oversold
description: Deeply oversold by multiple oscillators, likely overshooting fair value
universe: latest_indicators
tags: [value, oversold, williams-r, stochastic]
---
SELECT symbol FROM latest_indicators WHERE williams_r_14 < -70 AND stoch_k < 30 AND rsi_14 < 40 ORDER BY williams_r_14 ASC LIMIT 20
